        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-05\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-05\"><h2>5</h2><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"xyz\" data-display-mode=\"false\">xyz</span> 空間において，半径1の球 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\">D</span> の中心が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"xy\" data-display-mode=\"false\">xy</span> 平面上の4つの線分</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--cases structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=0\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=0\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"x=0\\quad(-5\\leqq y\\leqq 5)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">x=0\\quad(-5\\leqq y\\leqq 5)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=x\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=x\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"y=-x\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">y=-x\\quad(-5\\leqq x\\leqq 5)</span></div></div></div><p class=\"prose\">上を動くとする。このとき，球 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"D\" data-display-mode=\"false\">D</span> の通過する部分を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\">W</span> とおく。</p><h3>(1)</h3><p class=\"prose\">平面 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"z=t\" data-display-mode=\"false\">z=t</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"-1\\leqq t\\leqq 1\" data-display-mode=\"false\">-1\\leqq t\\leqq 1</span>）における，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\">W</span> の断面積を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"S(t)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">S(t)</span> とおくと，</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"S(t)=\\boxed{\\text{か}}\\left\\{10\\left(\\boxed{\\text{き}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}-\\left(\\boxed{\\text{け}}+\\boxed{\\text{こ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}-\\pi\\right)(1-t^{2})\\right\\}\" data-display-mode=\"true\">S(t)=\\boxed{\\text{か}}\\left\\{10\\left(\\boxed{\\text{き}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)\\sqrt{1-t^{2}}-\\left(\\boxed{\\text{け}}+\\boxed{\\text{こ}}\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}-\\pi\\right)(1-t^{2})\\right\\}</div><p class=\"prose\">である。</p><h3>(2)</h3><p class=\"prose\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"W\" data-display-mode=\"false\">W</span> の体積を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V</span> とおくと，</p><div class=\"formula\" data-katex=\"V=\\left(\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{さし}}}{3}+20\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)\\pi-\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{すせ}}}{3}\\left(\\boxed{\\text{そ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)\" data-display-mode=\"true\">V=\\left(\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{さし}}}{3}+20\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)\\pi-\\dfrac{\\boxed{\\text{すせ}}}{3}\\left(\\boxed{\\text{そ}}+\\sqrt{\\boxed{\\text{く}}}\\right)</div><p class=\"prose\">である。</p></article>"
      }
    ]
